.md
## More options for dark theme
By the default the dark theme is derived using a global window filter, that inverts color, adjusts hue and contrast. This is great for text and vector graphics, but it may confuse users if applied on raster images. We added a new option to address that:


![](/attachments/Screenshot-2026-09-10-at-14.01.42-455.png)

See it in the settings menu in UI section.


%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## More options for dark theme
By the default the dark theme is derived using a global window filter, that inverts color, adjusts hue and contrast. This is great for text and vector graphics, but it may confuse users if applied on raster images. We added a new option to address that:


![](/attachments/Screenshot-2026-09-10-at-14.01.42-455.png)

See it in the settings menu in UI section.


